{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Plot Summary\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summer comes and goes, and changes come quietly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/WJ_\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1742705861\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wan Jing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bright and cheerful, approachable top student with outstanding looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unexpectedly casual, but a little impatient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her hobbies are singing and badminton. Although they are just hobbies, her abilities are also outstanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is very popular, so she was asked by the class teacher to tutor his deskmate in the new semester, and she seems to have no objection to such a tough &quot;request&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/XLX_\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1742705861\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Xu Lianxia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although she has an impeccable face, she is a loner, so she has no sense of existence in the class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She lives his life drifting with the crowd, and her only hobbies are watching movies and playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her grades are not good, so she was entrusted to Wan Jing by the class teacher, hoping to make progress under Wan Jing's tutoring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It seems that she has known Wan Jing since before the third year of high school.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Game Features\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Short to medium-length plot, nearly 150,000 words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Exquisite character portraits and CG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Single ending, dual heroine perspectives bring immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is completely independently made by myself. If you have any questions, please contact me via email: <a href=\"mailto:llx31124945@163.com\">llx31124945@163.com</a></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589940?t=1742705861","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/b7b6725a1df1f6df9d700e48b33ffb145ba0303b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742705861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/e81e54fd4fb1c73b6c9c39b3b47fe9ac9dd4b92a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742705861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/e81e54fd4fb1c73b6c9c39b3b47fe9ac9dd4b92a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742705861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Plot Summary\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summer comes and goes, and changes come quietly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/WJ_\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1742705861\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wan Jing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bright and cheerful, approachable top student with outstanding looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unexpectedly casual, but a little impatient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her hobbies are singing and badminton. Although they are just hobbies, her abilities are also outstanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is very popular, so she was asked by the class teacher to tutor his deskmate in the new semester, and she seems to have no objection to such a tough &quot;request&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/XLX_\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1742705861\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Xu Lianxia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although she has an impeccable face, she is a loner, so she has no sense of existence in the class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She lives his life drifting with the crowd, and her only hobbies are watching movies and playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her grades are not good, so she was entrusted to Wan Jing by the class teacher, hoping to make progress under Wan Jing's tutoring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It seems that she has known Wan Jing since before the third year of high school.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Game Features\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Short to medium-length plot, nearly 150,000 words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Exquisite character portraits and CG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Single ending, dual heroine perspectives bring immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is completely independently made by myself. If you have any questions, please contact me via email: <a href=\"mailto:llx31124945@163.com\">llx31124945@163.com</a></p>","developers":["LSAusa"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/7bedda844f383b430d82e9d057670512f6ea08c0/header.jpg?t=1742705861","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113411,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113411/movie480.mp4?t=1742639597","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c